<section id="expenses-view" hidden aria-labelledby="expenses-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h1 id="expenses-title">Gastos del negocio</h1><p id="expenses-scope" class="hint"></p></div><div class="form-actions"><button id="expenses-categories" class="secondary" data-icon="pen-to-square" type="button" hidden>Categorías de gastos</button><button id="expense-new" class="primary" data-icon="plus" type="button" hidden>Registrar gasto</button></div></div><p id="expenses-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <section id="expenses-list"><form id="expenses-filter" class="report-filters"><div><label for="expenses-from">Desde</label><input id="expenses-from" type="date" min="2023-01-01" required></div><div><label for="expenses-to">Hasta</label><input id="expenses-to" type="date" min="2023-01-01" required></div><div><label for="expenses-category">Categoría</label><select id="expenses-category"></select></div><div><label for="expenses-origin">Origen</label><select id="expenses-origin"><option value="">Todos</option><option value="caja">Efectivo de caja</option><option value="externo">Fondos externos</option></select></div><div><label for="expenses-search">Folio, concepto o beneficiario</label><input id="expenses-search" type="search" maxlength="100"></div><button class="primary" data-icon="magnifying-glass" type="submit">Consultar</button></form>
        <dl id="expenses-summary" class="report-summary"></dl><p class="hint">Incluye solo gastos registrados en este módulo. Un retiro para depósito no es un gasto. Los pagos de compras a proveedores se registran en Cuentas por pagar.</p><h2>Por categoría</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Categoría</th><th>Registros</th><th>Total pagado</th></tr></thead><tbody id="expenses-groups"></tbody></table></div><h2>Gastos del periodo</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Folio / fecha</th><th>Categoría / concepto</th><th>Responsable</th><th>Origen</th><th>Importe</th><th>Acciones</th></tr></thead><tbody id="expenses-rows"></tbody></table></div><button id="expenses-more" class="secondary" type="button" hidden>Cargar más gastos</button>
    </section>
    <section id="expense-editor" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="expense-editor-title">Registrar gasto</h2><button id="expense-back" class="secondary" data-icon="arrow-left" type="button">Volver a gastos</button></div><p class="hint">Registra el gasto que ya pagaste. El importe es el total pagado, incluidos sus impuestos. No vuelvas a registrar aquí pagos a proveedores ni retiros que no sean gastos.</p><form id="expense-form"><fieldset id="expense-fields" class="adjust-fields"><div class="product-fields"><div><label for="expense-category">Categoría del gasto</label><select id="expense-category" required></select></div><div><label for="expense-date">Fecha del gasto</label><input id="expense-date" type="date" min="2023-01-01" required></div><div><label for="expense-origin">Origen del dinero</label><select id="expense-origin"><option value="caja">Efectivo de mi caja</option><option value="externo">Otra cuenta o fondos externos</option></select></div><div id="expense-turn-field"><label for="expense-turn">Mi turno abierto</label><select id="expense-turn"></select></div><div id="expense-account-field"><label for="expense-account">Cuenta o fondos utilizados</label><input id="expense-account" maxlength="100" placeholder="Ej. Cuenta bancaria del negocio"></div><div><label for="expense-method">Método de pago</label><select id="expense-method" required></select></div><div><label for="expense-amount">Importe total pagado</label><input id="expense-amount" type="number" min=".01" max="999999999999.99" step=".01" required></div><div><label for="expense-beneficiary">Beneficiario (opcional)</label><input id="expense-beneficiary" maxlength="150"></div><div><label for="expense-reference">Referencia o comprobante (opcional)</label><input id="expense-reference" maxlength="100"></div><div class="full-width"><label for="expense-description">Concepto o motivo del gasto</label><textarea id="expense-description" placeholder="Ej. Garrafón de agua o pago al velador" rows="2" maxlength="300" required></textarea></div></div><p id="expense-origin-help" class="hint"></p><label class="check-label"><input id="expense-confirm" type="checkbox" required> Confirmo que pagué este gasto y que no lo registré antes como salida de caja.</label></fieldset><p id="expense-error" class="message" role="alert"></p><button id="expense-save" class="primary" data-icon="check" type="submit">Registrar gasto</button></form></section>
    <section id="expense-detail" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="expense-detail-title"></h2><div class="form-actions"><button id="expense-print" class="secondary" data-icon="print" type="button">Imprimir comprobante</button><button id="expense-detail-back" class="secondary" data-icon="arrow-left" type="button">Volver a gastos</button></div></div><div id="expense-facts" class="expense-facts"></div></section>
    <section id="expense-categories-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h2>Categorías de gastos</h2><button id="expense-categories-back" class="secondary" data-icon="arrow-left" type="button">Volver a gastos</button></div><p class="hint">Solo el administrador crea, cambia o desactiva categorías. Las categorías inactivas conservan su historial.</p><div class="category-layout"><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Categoría</th><th>Estado</th><th>Acciones</th></tr></thead><tbody id="expense-category-rows"></tbody></table></div><form id="expense-category-form"><fieldset id="expense-category-fields" class="adjust-fields"><h3 id="expense-category-title">Crear categoría</h3><label for="expense-category-name">Nombre de la categoría</label><input id="expense-category-name" maxlength="80" required><label for="expense-category-active">Estado</label><select id="expense-category-active"><option value="1">Activa</option><option value="0">Inactiva</option></select></fieldset><p id="expense-category-error" class="message" role="alert"></p><div class="form-actions"><button id="expense-category-save" class="primary" data-icon="floppy-disk" type="submit">Guardar categoría</button><button id="expense-category-new" class="secondary" data-icon="plus" type="button">Nueva categoría</button></div></form></div></section>
    <div id="expense-receipt" class="ticket-paper" hidden></div>
</section>
